00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:33.940
a great deal about Tiffany Willis

00:04:34.574 --> 00:04:36.743
Fulton County investigation.

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:38.678
I mean, remember, there he is

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:40.346
caught on tape essentially

00:04:40.346 --> 00:04:43.516
