00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:50.323
He you know, he

00:04:50.323 --> 00:04:51.391
he participated,

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:53.660
I think the January six committee

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.428
evidence showed in a

00:04:55.428 --> 00:04:56.963
