00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:06.005
And those fake electors.

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:07.340
You know, apparently

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.576
some of them are are appear to be based

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:12.412
