And it's pretty clear

00:05:44.811 --> 00:05:46.279
you would not send that letter

00:05:46.279 --> 00:05:49.449
saying, you know, b, b, b, b, b, be

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:52.285
prepared for civil disorder.

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:55.655
If it was just Rudy Giuliani or

00:05:55.788 --> 00:05:56.856
or Mark Meadows

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:59.025
who was going to be in the dock.

00:05:59.025 --> 00:05:59.992
Let me ask you about the

00:05:59.992 --> 00:06:02.328
Jean Carroll case in New York.

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:04.063
The writer who accuses Trump

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:06.999
