00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:32.024
Can you tell us about that?

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:32.859
Yeah.

00:06:32.959 --> 00:06:33.359
What do you think

00:06:33.359 --> 00:06:36.095
the outcome of this case might be?

00:06:36.095 --> 00:06:38.531
Well, I'll it's a pretty simple story.

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:40.099
I mean, after

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:40.767
Jean Carroll

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:43.202
