00:08:28.541 --> 00:08:30.009
She's just a tremendously

00:08:30.009 --> 00:08:31.310
talented litigator.

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:32.912
And I just thought, well,

00:08:32.912 --> 00:08:34.413
no one is going to give me,

00:08:34.413 --> 00:08:35.448
Carol, better advice

00:08:35.448 --> 00:08:37.083
than than Robby Kaplan

00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:38.417
and no one's going to be able

00:08:38.417 --> 00:08:40.419
to suss out the details of this case

00:08:40.419 --> 00:08:41.487
and figure out

00:08:41.487 --> 00:08:42.221
whether it's a case

00:08:42.221 --> 00:08:44.323
that should be brought in Robby.

00:08:44.323 --> 00:08:45.458
And the next day,

00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:47.627
I somehow I connected them together

00:08:47.627 --> 00:08:49.996
and and then the next months

00:08:49.996 --> 00:08:50.997
later, apparently, you know,

00:08:50.997 --> 00:08:52.331
they determined to bring suit

00:08:52.331 --> 00:08:53.232
and they did.

00:08:53.332 --> 00:08:55.434
And you think this is where we are today

00:08:55.434 --> 00:08:57.270
and you think this this could be serious?

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.204
Trouble for Donald Trump?

00:08:59.305 --> 00:09:00.339
It could be.

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:01.274
I mean, you know, look,

00:09:01.274 --> 00:09:02.475
I don't want to predict what

00:09:02.475 --> 00:09:03.109
juries will do.

00:09:03.109 --> 00:09:04.777
I believe Eugene Carol.

00:09:04.777 --> 00:09:09.382
I believe it I've gotten to know her.

00:09:09.382 --> 00:09:11.317
I think she's a truthful

00:09:11.317 --> 00:09:13.352
and wonderful person, the kind person.

00:09:13.519 --> 00:09:15.454
She's somebody who doesn't say amnesty

00:09:15.454 --> 00:09:17.156
now has doesn't have a nasty word

